    <h1>About Foreign Immigration Services</h1>
    <p>Foreign Immigration Services is a privately operated Philippine immigration consultancy. We are accredited by the Bureau of Immigration as an Accredited Consultancy, and our practice is organised across four areas: Visa and Immigration Applications, Extensions and Compliance, Residency and Long-Term Status, and Corporate and Global Mobility.</p>

    <h2>Accreditation</h2>
    <p>Foreign Immigration Services holds Bureau of Immigration Accreditation No. CA-202623557. See our <a href="/accreditation/">Accreditation page</a> for details.</p>

    <h2>Institutional Representation</h2>
    <p>Foreign Immigration Services represents its work institutionally. Individual staff identities, titles and biographies are not published on this website, in keeping with our approach to client confidentiality and professional discretion. All communications and engagements are conducted through the firm's official channels rather than named individuals.</p>

    <h2>How to Reach Us</h2>
    <p>The direct way to reach Foreign Immigration Services is by email at <a href="mailto:info@foreignimmigration.ph">info@foreignimmigration.ph</a>. See our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a> for more information.</p>
